olor: #d4d4d4;"> =3D </span><span style=3D"color: #9cdcfe;">num1</span><spa=
n style=3D"color: #d4d4d4;"> / </span><span style=3D"color: #9cdcfe;">num2<=
/span><span style=3D"color: #d4d4d4;">;</span></div>
<div><span style=3D"color: #9cdcfe;">Console</span><span style=3D"color: #d=
